  DE-exact (176 keV): tau=0.344 -> g=2.821  -> DE=(9/2)a^4 T_c = 2.246 meV (1.00x)
  model central (193 keV): tau=0.378 -> g=2.968  -> DE=(9/2)a^4 T_c = 2.463 meV (1.09x)

